        {
          "text": "Acakulugwe ni ŵandu wosope ŵa liŵasa lyakwe ŵayice kukujigala cilu cakwe. Jemanjajo ŵawujile naco ciluco kumangwawo nipo ŵamsicile pasikati pa Sola ni Eshitawoli mwilembe lya baba ŵakwe Manowa. Jwalakwe ŵalamulile Aisalaeli kwa yaka 20.",
